{"message":"You can prevent blocks by adding a travel notification for your Platinum Rewards Card. According to our docs, you can add a travel notice through the Rho‑Bank mobile app, online banking (rhobank.com), or by contacting customer service (1-800-RHO-BANK or chat in the app). The Platinum Rewards Card has 0% foreign transaction fees, but sending a travel notice helps our fraud controls avoid blocking legitimate charges from Japan.

Would you like me to: 1) walk you through adding the notice yourself, or 2) add the travel notification for you now? If you want me to add it, I’ll need to verify your identity first (we’ll confirm any 2 of these: date of birth, email, phone number, or mailing address) and then I can proceed. If you’ll do it yourself, open the mobile app or online banking and look for the card or security/travel settings to add dates and destination (Japan).

A few quick tips: • Add the travel dates (start/end) and country (Japan). • Keep a backup payment method with you. • If you’d like, tell me the trip dates now so I can prepare the verification steps."}
